### ============================================================
### Reports — PDF / Excel
### Akses: kepala_lab | laboran | admin_sistem
### format wajib: pdf | excel
### Response = binary file (bukan JSON)
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@token = {{token}}

### Inventory — PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/inventory?format=pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inventory — Excel
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/inventory?format=excel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Borrowings — PDF (with date range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/borrowings?format=pdf&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Borrowings — Excel
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/borrowings?format=excel&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Damaged assets — PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/damaged-assets?format=pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Damaged assets — Excel
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/damaged-assets?format=excel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
